<p>Enter a fluid, mobile shooting stance that excels at close combat. Your ranged attack speed is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 19%, 23%, 26%, 28%</acronym> and each time you shoot you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25%, 33%, 39%, 45%, 50%</acronym> increased movement speed for 2 turns.</p><p>Ranged attacks against targets will also grant you up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 6%, 8%, 9%, 10%</acronym> of a turn. This is 100% effective against targets within 3 tiles, and decreases by 20% for each tile beyond that (to 0% at 8 tiles). This cannot occur more than once per turn.</p><p>Requires a sling to use.</p>